Firmware transport dependency
-----------------------------
firmware/lib/FortMeter/src/ModbusMaster.h and ModbusMaster.cpp are based on
Doc Walker's ModbusMaster v2.0.1 and retain their Apache-2.0 notices. The
upstream Apache license, source hashes and patch are preserved under
firmware/lib/FortMeter/third_party/ModbusMaster/. The integration adds a runtime
response deadline, cooperative cancellation and initialization fixes; its wire
transaction code remains ModbusMaster and is identified as 2.0.1+fort.1.
The upstream util/crc16.h retains its BSD-3-Clause notice and util/word.h retains its GPL-3.0-or-later notice.
Original FortTransport/FortDiagnostics code is GPL-3.0-only, as is the rest of
this project's original firmware. These statements do not relicense the
upstream files. The Arduino library ZIP includes these sources and notices.

OLED animation
--------------
firmware/assets/oled/ contains the original 772-frame animation supplied and
owned by the project author. The frame pack preserves that artwork losslessly.
The animation, decoder, timing, persistence and integration code are included
as original project contributions under GPL-3.0-only.
